 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K_fbLFrH7H8Q7kNvwHfUDaH&_nc_oc=Adp2_8aUJeugldR0_eCyK4LFJbghjbLGvbBVPiOm56z0rOraHdeYdjhpY59FVK0_zGM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI0-A0CBbmIp_KmCUqQ_s65YGHrgREf-DiBpJ4j_ZSMpQ&oe=6A9AE141"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OmUVDx091Y8Q7kNvwEG_JrS&_nc_oc=Adpz-LszFmq-dJR2QLGMxJIhuYElAlCByk34hRzapHTvTYzq99-pKXcRT5xmk76nikM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLKDrKW9kNXne9OI7y1h4Om9yfvQZtG4lL2Y-EvWzFsug&oe=6A9AEEA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uFmnHjkaERMQ7kNvwF1SRK2&_nc_oc=Adray0W4EotILla2SIAe8xTl5mcNNgYxhRRsFf_0DEfqfNpbPhtMiIa4xaFDQ1nbzYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLLAC48K6jUoMJuAVwXIfudTD2gextasN0YT1pRm8JheA&oe=6A9AC05C"}, {"fil